fault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-27T16:34:33Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T14:50:12Z","closed_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:17Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106876","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106876.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106876.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-28T14:48:17Z"},"body":"- Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104522\r\n\r\nThe parameter `force_trivial` was always just a way to resize the `LocalVector` without calling default initializers (to save time).\r\nNow, this is no longer required - users can simply call `resize_uninitialized`! This makes it explicit where a resize is happening without filling values.\r\n\r\nThis PR should not change behavior, just simplify matters and improve code style.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n- I've checked `changed_items` and `_cull_hits`, they never called `resize` so the `force_trivial` parameter was useless for both.\r\n- `force_trivial` behavior handling is bubbled up to `PooledList`. It is somewhat questionable whether it is appropriate here, because it is only used to create one object at a time. Still, this is outside the scope of this PR to change.\r\n- `_active_map` and `freelist` use a trivial type so they don't initialize on `resize` (regardless of `force_trivial`). I took the opportunity to make this explicit using `resize_uninitialized`, as we'll make that a goal soon anyway.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106876/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106876/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}